  "body": "Set on a private, sunny, elevated freehold title with it's own driveway, located moments from Milford Beach this brand new residence is simply stunning. Excellent design and quality craftsmanship have created this superb home with attention to detail, purpose-built, bespoke fittings and finishes found inside and out, double glazed joinery and generous stud height. Offering lovely open plan kitchen, living and dining spaces which flow seamlessly to outdoor entertaining areas. There is a second lounge on the ground floor with access to it's own private deck and courtyard area.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen boasts plenty of space, integrated Gaggenau appliances, walk in scullery/laundry and is well positioned for entertaining. Comprising four bedrooms, two bathrooms plus guest wc, including an exquisite master-suite complete with a spacious walk in wardrobe and ensuite bathroom.\r\n\r\nProperties of this calibre in this location are extremely rare and hard to come by, don't miss this limited opportunity to secure this incredible home.\r\n\r\nExpressions of Interest Close | Thursday 26th November 2026 at 4pm (unless sold prior)",
